  "body": "Some homes just feel right the moment you walk in. 81 Skulander Crescent is one of them.\r\n\r\nPerfectly blending timeless, natural cedar with robust, solid brick, this brand-new architectural masterpiece has been crafted with an uncompromising eye for detail. Built by true craftsmen and backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this home offers your family ultimate luxury, supreme comfort, and absolute long-term peace of mind.\r\n\r\nA Ground Floor Made for Memories;\r\nStep inside and let the gorgeous timber hard flooring guide you through a spectacularly spacious, light-filled sanctuary. The heart of the home is a magnificent open-plan family domain. Here, a chef-inspired kitchen boasts stunning Italian tiling and premium finishes, making it a joy to cook while staying connected with the family. Overhead, striking architectural skylights capture the sun, flooding the entire living area with natural warmth and a bright, uplifting energy.\r\n\r\nUncompromised Comfort, Every Single Day;\r\nNew Zealand weather can be unpredictable, but your indoor climate won't be. Experience the absolute luxury of a fully ducted central heating system that wraps the whole house in perfect warmth. On crisp mornings, your toes will love the cozy bliss of underfloor heating beneath the designer bathroom tiles.\r\n\r\nSpace, Versatility & Luxury for Everyone;\r\nWhether you have a growing family, teenagers wanting their own space, or elderly parents living with you, this clever 6-bedroom layout accommodates everyone effortlessly:\r\n• 6 Generous Double Bedrooms: Sun-drenched and designed to give every family member their own quiet retreat.\r\n• 2 Opulent Master Ensuites: Features bespoke vanities, premium fittings, and a true 'luxury hotel' vibe.\r\n• 3 Designer Bathrooms: Lavishly finished with floor-to-ceiling Italian tiling and underfloor warmth.\r\n• Outside, the seamless indoor-outdoor flow invites you to host summer BBQs, watch the kids play, or simply unwind in your own private yard.\r\n\r\nWhy This Home Stands Out:\r\n• Protection: 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for total confidence.\r\n• Premium Construction: Low-maintenance, high-durability Cedar and Brick exterior.\r\n• All-Season Comfort: Ducted central heating + underfloor heating in all bathrooms.\r\n• Architectural Flair: Feature skylights that elevate the space with natural light.\r\n• Elite Flooring: Luxury timber hard flooring and hand-selected Italian tiles.\r\n\r\nThe Location: Nestled in a highly desirable, family-friendly pocket. You are minutes away from top-tier schools, local amenities, beautiful beaches, and easy motorway access.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a brand-new 6-bedroom home of this calibre and craftsmanship—backed by a Master Build Guarantee—are incredibly rare. Don’t let someone else buy your dream home.\r\n\r\nContact us today for a private viewing or join us at this weekend's Open Homes!",
